WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.843
- Ourselves of course we are educators,

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:14.385
we are able to inspire our learners.

00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:18.274
In my case, if let's say
I want to encourage people

00:00:18.274 --> 00:00:19.940
to design buildings better,

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:22.340
it's not just a question of
showing them the principles

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.500
but we have to actually
construct a building

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.760
and ask them to come
inside it, feel how it is,

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:28.593
then they'll be more interested

00:00:28.593 --> 00:00:29.970
and say, "Yes, this works."

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.990
And then they can try it on their own.

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:34.530
- We could take it to step
further, really, to say

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.260
okay, if we are introducing circularity,

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.410
what are the other options?

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.280
Because people then they need options.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.900
If I look at the history
of textiles in Africa,

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:46.590
in Zambia, in particular,

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.620
we have people that already
are using tree fibres

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:53.630
to make a clothes.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.470
- I think this is one topic

00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:57.660
which is common for both of us

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:59.243
I work in the field of
construction industry, of course

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.550
but we use natural fibres a lot,

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.660
so pineapple fibers,
banana fibres and coconut.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:10.270
- I think that has potential to dominate

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:14.410
or to be very, very
powerful in the future.

00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.130
- Actually, I have got high hopes

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.830
from the young generation

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:20.750
because I think they are
environmentally aware now.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:22.223
When we talk of these things to them,

00:01:22.223 --> 00:01:24.480
they seem to want to do things,

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:29.230
but it's not always possible
for them to know what to do.

